@HostAddress = https://localhost:7174
@eventsUrl = {{HostAddress}}/events

### 1. Create a new event
# @name createEvent
POST {{eventsUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Architecture Review",
  "description": "Quarterly system design and performance review meeting",
  "startAt": "2026-10-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endAt": "2026-10-10T11:30:00Z"
}

### 2. Get all events
GET {{eventsUrl}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.1. Get events filtered by title
GET {{eventsUrl}}?title=Architecture
Accept: application/json

### 2.2. Get events filtered by date range
GET {{eventsUrl}}?from=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-31T23:59:59Z
Accept: application/json

### 2.3. Verify 400 Bad Request on invalid date filter (from > to)
GET {{eventsUrl}}?from=2026-10-31T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/problem+json


### 3. Get event by ID (using dynamic ID from the previous create response)
GET {{eventsUrl}}/{{createEvent.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Update existing event
PUT {{eventsUrl}}/{{createEvent.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Architecture Review (Extended)",
  "description": "Extended quarterly system design review",
  "startAt": "2026-10-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endAt": "2026-10-10T12:00:00Z"
}

### 5. Verify 404 Not Found (non-existent ID)
GET {{eventsUrl}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/problem+json

### 6. Verify 400 Bad Request (validation failure: EndAt before StartAt)
POST {{eventsUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/problem+json

{
  "title": "Invalid Event",
  "description": "EndAt is before StartAt",
  "startAt": "2026-10-10T12:00:00Z",
  "endAt": "2026-10-10T10:00:00Z"
}

### 7. Delete event
DELETE {{eventsUrl}}/{{createEvent.response.body.$.id}}

### 8. Verify deletion (expected 404 Not Found)
GET {{eventsUrl}}/{{createEvent.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/problem+json